+## 第 1 轮（2026-11-15 13:46）— brightness-13 默认形态 PASS
+
+- **镜像**：`brightness-13`，`boot.img` sha256
+  `c8c33b9e54965fb79752e60cfcf987e5d0675801e7544169073d1661ad674d74`（201,887,744 B）；
